## The problem

Social content is unstructured: video, captions, sounds and comments spread across platforms. That makes it hard to compare or analyse.

## What I built

A pipeline that breaks videos and posts (TikTok/Reels-style video, Facebook, LinkedIn, Reddit) into structured values, identifies the sound used, and stores everything in self-hosted Postgres for querying.

